menu "Shahbaz production composition"

config SHAHBAZ_ACTUATORS_ENABLE
    bool "Enable physical PWM actuator outputs"
    default n
    help
        Keep disabled for sensor-only bench builds. When enabled, the
        production composition still fails closed unless the exact-board
        actuator GPIO review evidence is configured, the pins validate as
        available-with-review GPIOs, and runtime memory validation passes.
        The board exposes four motor PWM outputs and two optional servo PWM
        outputs only after that gate succeeds.

endmenu
